      "live smoke result",
      "production/user evidence when available"
    ]
  },
  "hypothesis": "If query scoping and relevance ranking are tightened while source verification and interaction semantics remain unchanged, useful-answer rate will improve without increasing unsupported claims or cognitive effort.",
